entries[182719] = { ["name"] = "Mail Courier's Runners", ["text"] = "Binds when equipped\nFeet Mail\n12 Armor\n+6 [Agility or Intellect]\n+10 Stamina\n+ 5 Critical Strike\n+ 8 Mastery\nDurability 80 / 80\nThe Mail Courier (0/8)\nMail Courier's Greaves\nMail Courier's Runners\nMail Courier's Tunic\nMail Courier's Grips\nMail Courier's Cap\nMail Courier's Shoulderguards\nMail Courier's Belt\nMail Courier's Wristguards\n(2) Set : Taking damage from a Gargon or Darkhound increases your Armor by 138 for 20 sec. (20s cooldown)\n(3) Set : Taking Frost, Fire or Shadow damage grants you a shield for 20 sec that can absorb up to 972 of those damage types. Cannot occur more than once every 30 sec.\n(5) Set : Increase your run speed by 3% while outdoors in the Shadowlands.\nSell Price:" }
